 "notes": "Levels follow the Markdown (# count - 1). On p.43, 「第２部」 and 「将来像の実現に向けた計画 〔基本計画〕」 were merged and set to level 1. With sep=\"\", the merged text has no space after 「第２部」. The same heading repeated on p.44 (#/texts/1857) was changed to text, because the Markdown places it on p.43. The list_items 「Ⅰ 将来を担う子育て支援戦略」 and 「Ⅰ 地域と連携した学力向上戦略」 were changed to section_header level 4. 「【 重 点 戦 略 】」 was set to level 3; its spaced-out text was left as is (I did not edit the wording). Headings that appear only inside figures or diagrams — 【ゾーン】, 【拠点エリア】, 【将来都市構造】, 目指すべきまちの将来像, everything inside the p.44 structure diagram, and the slogan line — were changed to text. The SDGs icon labels on p.41 (#/texts/1811, 1824–1827) were left unchanged because I was unsure what to do with them."
